#### Unsavory Past (Water)

Kakita Hisa walked quietly into the courtyard. Her hair was impeccably styled, her new kimono folded perfectly, and her pose and stride measured and deliberate: the perfect picture of decorum. But a hush descended on the bystanders all the same. Eyes darted to the blade at her belt, and when she turned her back, gossipy courtiers flicked their fans to hide their mouths as they whispered, "Have you heard what happened during her gempuku…"

